<title>ITALY: Italy cabinet ratifies central bank appointment.</title>
<headline>Italy cabinet ratifies central bank appointment.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian cabinet on Thursday ratified the appointment of Antonio Finocchiaro as a deputy director general of the Bank of Italy, a cabinet statement said.</p>
<p>The cabinet has to ratify central bank appointments.</p>
<p>Finocchiaro's nomination to the position, held previously by Tommaso Padoa Schioppa, now head of bourse watchdog Consob, was announced earlier this month by the Bank of Italy.</p>
<p>--Rome newsroom +39 6 678 2505</p>
</text>
